  "description": "Experience contract for the Program Runtime operator console. Its primary user is an agent that never opens it, so every surface is forensic rather than task-oriented and the layout follows an IDE: binding registry as symbol explorer, corpus as file history, program detail as editor, sessions as debug sessions with a watch window. Two journeys anchor it — triage of a failed program, and the day-one question of what an agent cannot call.",
